From: E App (round 7, app-auth-email-otp)
Subject: register the guardian code sign-in routes

server/signin/code.js (new, stream E) exports `routes`: POST /api/auth/code (send a 6-digit code by ACS Email; the phone
channel is behind the same provider interface and answers 501 phone.unavailable) and POST /api/auth/code/verify (sign
in with the code; the same createSession as password login). No migration: codes are rows of password_reset (019) keyed
`code:` + sha256(guardian id, code). Needs ACS_CONNECTION_STRING and ACS_SENDER, the ones the forgot-password mail
already uses. Apply with `git apply`.

